'''Special Treatment''' (お薬出しておきますね, ''O Kusuri Dashiteokimasune'', '''I'll Give You Medicine''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': "Knockback" Effect UP (M): Knockback distance increases by 20%.

'''Pre 4.7''': "Weaken" Effect UP (M): Weaken duration increases by 20%.

